# The voices' test with the banks on the disk (fixtures/sound: English
# texts and voices on the Sound Blaster), on pcmusic, whose track 9
# plays under the options, and the CD's own game directory, its VOX
# beside the HQR files. Right steps the voices to French and German,
# each bank read from the disk and its test voice spoken, the track
# playing on through both and back on the options.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Down Right
sleep 5
shot fr
key Right
sleep 5
shot de
key Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot options
